{
    "title": "Bug ID - Insect Identifier",
    "description": "Want to easily identify different species of insects, bugs, and spiders? Meet Bug ID\u2014your guide to the fascinating world of entomology! Simply take a photo of any insect, and our bug identifier will recognize it instantly and tell you everything about it.\r\n\r\nEver spotted an unknown bug in your garden and wondered if it\u2019s a pest or a beneficial insect? Seen a crawling bug in your home and worried if it can bite you? Or just willing to know more about nature and explore the world of bugs and spiders? Bug ID\u2014Insect Identifier has you covered!\r\n\r\nWhat can you do with Bug ID\u2014Insect Identifier at your side?\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc1e Identify insects and learn everything about them\r\n\r\nYou don\u2019t have to know all the distinctive features of every species, as our bug finder does! Just snap any insect, bug, spider, snail, or slug, and our cutting-edge AI technology will identify it immediately.  \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc1b Learn every detail about any insect\r\n\r\nOur bug identifier knows everything about insects and spiders! Explore clear photos of each insect at all stages of its development and learn about the impact of every species on other organisms. Find out the distribution and active seasons of every insect. Study in-depth insect descriptions and get advice on control and prevention of a pest infestation. Our entomology experts prepared exhaustive profiles of every insect!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc1c Track your finds\r\n\r\nNever lose the insects and spiders you\u2019ve recognized! You don\u2019t need to keep records of every pest spotted in the garden or a beautiful butterfly seen in the park, as all your finds are automatically saved in Snap history. Exploring nature with our bug finder is easy and fun!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd8b Build and manage custom collections\r\n\r\nArrange your custom collections of bugs, insects, and spiders and navigate them with ease thanks to the smooth interface of our bug identifier. Build up your insect collections, access them instantly, and keep essential information at hand anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\nReady to become an entomology guru? Want to keep all pests at bay? Or eager to follow your passion for nature? Download our bug identifier to learn everything about insects, bugs, and spiders!\r\n\r\nSubscribe to Bug ID Premium to get unlimited access to all the app\u2019s features:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Subscriptions are billed weekly, monthly, or annually at the rate depending on the subscription plan.\r\n\u2022 Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\r\n\r\nAll personal data is protected in accordance with the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy:\r\nhttps://aiby.mobi/insectid_android/terms/\r\nhttps://aiby.mobi/insectid_android/privacy/\r\n\r\nFor any questions or inquiries, please use our customer support form at \r\nhttps://aiby.mobi/insectid_android/support/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Want to easily identify different species of insects, bugs, and spiders? Meet Bug ID\u2014your guide to the fascinating world of entomology! Simply take a photo of any insect, and our bug identifier will recognize it instantly and tell you everything about it.<br><br>Ever spotted an unknown bug in your garden and wondered if it\u2019s a pest or a beneficial insect? Seen a crawling bug in your home and worried if it can bite you? Or just willing to know more about nature and explore the world of bugs and spiders? Bug ID\u2014Insect Identifier has you covered!<br><br>What can you do with Bug ID\u2014Insect Identifier at your side?<br><br>\ud83d\udc1e Identify insects and learn everything about them<br><br>You don\u2019t have to know all the distinctive features of every species, as our bug finder does! Just snap any insect, bug, spider, snail, or slug, and our cutting-edge AI technology will identify it immediately.  <br><br>\ud83d\udc1b Learn every detail about any insect<br><br>Our bug identifier knows everything about insects and spiders! Explore clear photos of each insect at all stages of its development and learn about the impact of every species on other organisms. Find out the distribution and active seasons of every insect. Study in-depth insect descriptions and get advice on control and prevention of a pest infestation. Our entomology experts prepared exhaustive profiles of every insect!<br><br>\ud83d\udc1c Track your finds<br><br>Never lose the insects and spiders you\u2019ve recognized! You don\u2019t need to keep records of every pest spotted in the garden or a beautiful butterfly seen in the park, as all your finds are automatically saved in Snap history. Exploring nature with our bug finder is easy and fun!<br><br>\ud83e\udd8b Build and manage custom collections<br><br>Arrange your custom collections of bugs, insects, and spiders and navigate them with ease thanks to the smooth interface of our bug identifier. Build up your insect collections, access them instantly, and keep essential information at hand anytime, anywhere.<br><br>Ready to become an entomology guru? Want to keep all pests at bay? Or eager to follow your passion for nature? Download our bug identifier to learn everything about insects, bugs, and spiders!<br><br>Subscribe to Bug ID Premium to get unlimited access to all the app\u2019s features:<br><br>\u2022 Subscriptions are billed weekly, monthly, or annually at the rate depending on the subscription plan.<br>\u2022 Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.<br><br>All personal data is protected in accordance with the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy:<br>https://aiby.mobi/insectid_android/terms/<br>https://aiby.mobi/insectid_android/privacy/<br><br>For any questions or inquiries, please use our customer support form at <br>https://aiby.mobi/insectid_android/support/",
